# Akan Name Generator

## Author
Tania Okoth

## Project Description
This web application calculates the day of the week a user was born and assigns them an Akan name based on Ghanaian naming culture.

## How It Works
- User enters birth date
- User selects gender
- JavaScript calculates weekday using a mathematical formula
- App returns correct Akan name

## Features
- Input validation
- Gender selection
- Accurate weekday calculation
- Dynamic result display
- Clean UI with animations

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Setup Instructions
1. Clone repository
2. Open index.html in browser

